NOT INVESTMENT ADVICE. This software produces statistical descriptions of
historical market behaviour. It is a research and educational tool. It does not
constitute investment advice, and no one involved is your financial adviser.
Markets can and do behave in ways no historical corpus contains.

THIRD-PARTY DATA. Market prices are retrieved via yfinance and OpenBB. Filings
come from the SEC EDGAR public API. News is retrieved from public web sources
and is cited with links; article text is not redistributed in this repository.
Each source carries its own terms, and this MIT license covers only the code and
the derived analysis in this repository, not the underlying data.
